Also to the north, visit the Great Sanctuary of Our Lady of Fatima Shrine, a place of worldwide"},{"kind":"text","t":24690.069006,"text":"También hacia el norte, visite el Gran Santuario de Nuestra Señora de Fátima, un lugar de alcance mundial"},{"kind":"audio","t":24744.847644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":24749.527278,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24754.841803,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24760.02991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24761.44546,"samples":15928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":31548.887319999998,"text":"According to Japan's nuclear agency, radioactive casein and iodine has been identified at the plant."},{"kind":"text","t":31947.942414,"text":"Según la agencia nuclear de Japón, se ha identificado caseína radiactiva y yodo en la planta."},{"kind":"audio","t":31990.998467,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31992.508905,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31994.065044,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31995.675991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31995.990836,"samples":5128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":40603.99546,"text":"The document, according to the leak, will refer to the borders dispute, which Palestine wants based on the borders before the 1967 Mideast War."},{"kind":"text","t":41306.059312,"text":"El documento, según la filtración, se referirá a la disputa fronteriza, la cual Palestina desea basada en las fronteras anteriores a la Guerra de Medio Oriente de 1967."},{"kind":"audio","t":41375.323715,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41380.349954,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41385.610049999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41390.671809,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41396.13970199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41401.533476,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41407.479922,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41410.740015999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41411.369376999995,"samples":16856,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":46950.18569,"text":"The capital of Moldova is Chisinau. The local language is Romanian but Russian."},{"kind":"text","t":47185.311415,"text":"La capital de Moldavia es Chisinau. El idioma local es el rumano pero el ruso."},{"kind":"audio","t":47233.92402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47236.08521999999,"samples":26632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":47301.080842999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47305.705927999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":47306.006594,"samples":1664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":56073.016205,"text":"The other nominations include Best Picture, Director of Cinematography, Costume Design, Film Editing, Original Score,"},{"kind":"text","t":56537.799672999994,"text":"Las otras nominaciones incluyen Mejor Película, Dirección de Fotografía, Diseño de Vestuario, Montaje, Banda Sonora Original,"},{"kind":"audio","t":56592.838047,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56597.922685,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56603.204400999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56608.398957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56613.550935,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56616.797189,"samples":25760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"input","t":61331.603009,"text":"production design, sound editing, sound mixing, and original screenplay."},{"kind":"text","t":61651.685826999994,"text":"diseño de producción, edición de sonido, mezcla de sonido y guion original."},{"kind":"audio","t":61696.920638999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":61701.671471999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61707.008986999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61707.924704,"samples":12096,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":67556.16309500001,"text":"Prior to the arrival of troops, Haiti had not encountered problems related to the disease since the 18th century."},{"kind":"text","t":67987.296936,"text":"Antes de la llegada de las tropas, Haití no había enfrentado problemas relacionados con la enfermedad desde el siglo XVIII."},{"kind":"audio","t":68037.677196,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":68042.677776,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68047.84341300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68053.15335800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68059.455909,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":68059.859044,"samples":7760,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":75356.202049,"text":"With two years of the end of the war, the former allies were now enemies and the Cold War began."},{"kind":"text","t":75757.079177,"text":"A dos años del fin de la guerra, los antiguos aliados eran ahora enemigos y comenzó la Guerra Fría."},{"kind":"audio","t":75815.515443,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75820.537523,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75825.935916,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75831.43702900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":75832.04639,"samples":12328,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":85388.126288,"text":"In fact, it is not easy to find at all even if one knew it existed once inside the cave it is a total isolation"},{"kind":"text","t":85931.697334,"text":"De hecho, no es nada fácil de encontrar, incluso si uno supiera que existió alguna vez; dentro de la cueva es un aislamiento total."},{"kind":"audio","t":85989.550109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":85994.273432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85999.580487,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86003.317094,"samples":28296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":86049.446374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86050.535019,"samples":31432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"input","t":98257.67598100001,"text":"Unfortunately, stunning traffic flow is difficult because driver behavior cannot be predicted with 100% certainty."},{"kind":"text","t":98850.124649,"text":"Desafortunadamente, un flujo de tráfico impresionante es difícil porque el comportamiento del conductor no se puede predecir con un 100% de certeza."},{"kind":"audio","t":98914.686728,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98919.841266,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98925.130801,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":98931.37152300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98936.545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98941.847225,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98945.902418,"samples":31992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"input","t":108587.792396,"text":"In 2002, Goma was destroyed by lava from the Nyirangogo volcano, which buried most of the town's streets, particularly the town of Goma."},{"kind":"text","t":109327.60611600001,"text":"En 2002, Goma fue destruida por la lava del volcán Nyirangogo, que sepultó la mayoría de las calles de la ciudad, particularmente la ciudad de Goma."},{"kind":"audio","t":109391.20731900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109396.437795,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109401.621052,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":109407.00965600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109412.198583,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":109418.032571,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109418.82632000001,"samples":13992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"input","t":114612.96168200001,"text":"Rolando Mendoza fired his M16 rifle at the terrorist."},{"kind":"text","t":114895.356901,"text":"Rolando Mendoza disparó su rifle M16 al terrorista."},{"kind":"audio","t":114934.74095600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114936.03374700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114937.19967100001,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"input","t":123372.057436,"text":"If you're not used to driving on country roads, keep your wits about you. Steep grades, narrow lanes, and sharp curves predominate."},{"kind":"text","t":123728.65648800001,"text":"Si no estás acostumbrado a conducir por carreteras secundarias, mantente alerta. Predominan las pendientes pronunciadas, los carriles estrechos y las curvas cerradas."},{"kind":"audio","t":123785.28723,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123790.563165,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123795.90698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123798.113799,"samples":19896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"audio","t":123855.49188,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123860.51049900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123865.772305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123868.47520700001,"samples":22896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":132515.677438,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":132915.282994,"text":"La mayoría de los telescopios de investigación modernos son instalaciones enormes en zonas remotas con condiciones atmosféricas favorables."},{"kind":"audio","t":132974.315952,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":132975.433186,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132977.034063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132978.642031,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132980.24699800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132981.839725,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132981.999933,"samples":6792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":138539.562982,"text":"The cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic, basic, alkaline the chemical is."},{"kind":"text","t":138925.263214,"text":"El jugo de col cambia de color dependiendo de qué tan ácido, básico o alcalino sea el químico."},{"kind":"audio","t":138982.280941,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138987.29074,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138992.285719,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138997.559855,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138997.828171,"samples":4528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":145349.15949,"text":"This offers a good opportunity to see the Aurora Borealis as the sky will be dark more or less around the time."},{"kind":"text","t":145778.741223,"text":"Esto ofrece una buena oportunidad para ver la aurora boreal, ya que el cielo estará oscuro más o menos a esa hora."},{"kind":"audio","t":145828.687779,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":145833.832876,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145836.579348,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145838.269554,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145839.300209,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":900},{"kind":"input","t":151608.230808,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":151913.09633,"text":"Así que es probable que la notación se haya añadido simplemente como una etiqueta."},{"kind":"audio","t":151969.613854,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151974.428686,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151979.639382,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151981.701913,"samples":18696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":158520.494608,"text":"Parisians have a reputation for being egocentric, rude, and arrogant."},{"kind":"text","t":158870.541153,"text":"Los parisinos tienen fama de ser egocéntricos, groseros y arrogantes."},{"kind":"audio","t":158925.053135,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":158930.167513,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158935.440208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158935.79002400002,"samples":7296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":164519.285267,"text":"A curry is a dish based on herbs and spices together with either meat or vegetables."},{"kind":"text","t":164870.096631,"text":"El curry es un plato a base de hierbas y especias junto con carne o verduras."},{"kind":"audio","t":164914.962898,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164919.85443900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164925.114455,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164926.762192,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"close","t":175705.384843,"code":1005}]}